// CoalWash — Antigravity (AG 2.0) hooks template, per the v2.3.1 primary spec
// (antigravity.google/docs/hooks, fetched 2026-07-23).
//
// Copy this file to ONE of:
//   - project:  <workspace>/.agents/hooks.json
//   - global:   ~/.gemini/config/hooks.json
// then replace __COALWASH_DIR__ with the directory holding CoalWash's hooks/ +
// scripts/lib (a global file-copy install puts them at
// ~/.gemini/config/skills/coalwash — copy the WHOLE plugin tree: the adapter
// imports ../scripts/lib).
//
// If AG's parser rejects // comments, strip these comment lines — the object
// below is otherwise strict JSON. (Mirrors the repo's platform-configs idiom
// and CoalHearth's AG template — one flock.)
//
// Event mapping (AG has no SessionStart; full facts + named limitations:
// skills/coalwash/references/platform-ag.md):
//   PreInvocation -> first-of-conversation SILENT gauge (tmp-marker guarded)
//                    + the 0p seatbelt sweep (drop FYI via injectSteps).
//   Stop          -> the band ask/directive delivery: {decision:'continue',
//                    reason} — AG's real enforcement analogue of CC's
//                    Stop-block; nothing pending answers {decision:'allow'}.
//   PreToolUse    -> the 0p airbag (pre-edit snapshot of class-B files) +
//                    seatbelt enqueue; always answers {decision:'ask'} (the
//                    neutral value — never widens, never blocks).
// PostToolUse is deliberately NOT registered: its payload carries no
// toolCall and its output is ignored — nothing CoalWash can honestly use.
// timeout is in SECONDS (AG spec; default 30).
{
  "coalwash": {
    "PreInvocation": [
      { "type": "command", "command": "node \"__COALWASH_DIR__/hooks/coalwash-ag.js\" PreInvocation", "timeout": 30 }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      { "type": "command", "command": "node \"__COALWASH_DIR__/hooks/coalwash-ag.js\" Stop", "timeout": 30 }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "write_to_file|replace_file_content|multi_replace_file_content",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "node \"__COALWASH_DIR__/hooks/coalwash-ag.js\" PreToolUse", "timeout": 30 }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
